    "content": "Current task: fix blank preview WITHOUT breaking your UI\n\n🔴 Root cause (from your grep)\napp/master-os/preview-frame.tsx ✅\napp/master-os/page.tsx ❌ (duplicate iframe)\n👉 You have TWO preview sources fighting each other\nThat’s why:\n✔ requests fire\n❌ preview shows blank / inconsistent\n\n🎯 Goal\n✔ ONE preview source only\n✔ Stable refresh\n✔ Keep your current UI layout\n\n🔥 CLEAN FIX (nano — safe, no layout break)\n\n✅ STEP 1 — open file\nBashnano app/master-os/page.tsx\n\n✅ STEP 2 — REMOVE inline iframe (CRITICAL)\nSearch:\nBashCtrl + W\niframe\nYou will see something like:\nTypeScript<iframe\n  src={`/api/dev/preview?projectId=repo-test&v=${Date.now()}`}\n  style={styles.preview}\n/>\n👉 DELETE that entire iframe block\n\n✅ STEP 3 — IMPORT preview component\nAt the top of file, add:\nTypeScriptimport PreviewFrame from \"./preview-frame\";\n\n✅ STEP 4 — ADD SINGLE preview (clean)\nFind where preview should render (keep layout)\nReplace with:\nTypeScript<PreviewFrame projectId=\"repo-test\" />\n\n✅ FINAL STRUCTURE (important)\nYour layout should look like:\nTypeScript<div style={styles.container}>\n\n  {/* your existing UI */}\n  <textarea ... />\n  <div style={styles.row}>...</div>\n  {drafts.map(...)}\n\n  {/* ✅ ONLY ONE PREVIEW */}\n  <PreviewFrame projectId=\"repo-test\" />\n\n  {/* logs */}\n  <div style={styles.log}>...</div>\n\n</div>\n\n✅ STEP 5 — SAVE\nBashCtrl + O → Enter\nCtrl + X\n\n✅ STEP 6 — restart clean\nBashrm -rf .next\nnpm run dev\n\n✅ EXPECTED RESULT\n✔ preview no longer blank\n✔ preview updates\n✔ no duplicate rendering\n✔ UI unchanged\n\n🧠 Why this fixes it\nBefore:\n❌ page.tsx iframe (Date.now spam)\n❌ preview-frame iframe\n→ conflict → blank\nNow:\n✔ single source of truth\n✔ controlled refresh\n✔ stable rendering\n\n⚠️ If still blank (only 1 possibility)\nThen your preview route is fine but React bundle isn’t mounting.\nTest quickly:\nOpen browser:\nBashhttp://localhost:3000/api/dev/preview?projectId=repo-test\nIf blank there → preview route issue\n\nIf NOT blank → UI duplication issue (now fixed)\n\n🚀 Next step\nSay:\nmake preview auto-refresh ONLY after apply (not constant Date.now spam)\nThat’s the final polish.",
